<h2 id="iconoclast-omega" class="removed"><a href="https://twilight-imperium.fandom.com/wiki/The_Naalu_Collective#Mech:~:text=Iconoclast">Iconoclast &Omega;</a> (replaced by &Omega;&Omega;) <sub>(Mech)</sub></h2>
